            "body": "> flash definitely does use the command line for me, showing the full search text when using \"jump mode\"\n\nIt definitely does not use command line, but floating window. This is documented [in the config](https://github.com/folke/flash.nvim?tab=readme-ov-file#%EF%B8%8F-configuration) (`prompt` is \"options for the floating window that shows the prompt\") and floating window is used [in the code itself](https://github.com/folke/flash.nvim/blob/3c942666f115e2811e959eabbdd361a025db8b63/lua/flash/prompt.lua#L46).",
